      "content": "REST API providing programmatic access to US court opinions, PACER docket data, judge records, financial disclosures, oral argument audio, citation lookup and network analysis, search alerts, and case visualizations. Operated by the Free Law Project.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Free Law Project\n Email: info@free.law",
